    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bimika Dawidi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Abisirayeli bose bateranira aho Dawidi yari ari i Heburoni baravuga bati “Umva turi amaraso yawe, turi ubura bwawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Umva . . . bwawe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Reba Itang 29.14.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bihe bya kera ubwo Sawuli yari umwami, ni wowe watabazaga Abisirayeli ukabataburura, kandi Uwiteka Imana yawe yarakubwiye iti ‘Ni wowe uzaragira ubwoko bwanjye bwa Isirayeli’. Kandi iti ‘Uzaba umugaba w'ubwoko bwanjye bwa Isirayeli.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abakuru ba Isirayeli bose basanga umwami i Heburoni, ahasezeranira na bo imbere y'Uwiteka isezerano, bimikisha Dawidi amavuta ngo abe umwami wa Isirayeli, nk'uko Uwiteka yavugiye muri Samweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 15.63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 1.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hanyuma Dawidi n'Abisirayeli bose bajya i Yerusalemu (ahitwa i Yebusi), kandi Abayebusi ni bo bari abaturage bo muri icyo gihugu bari basanzwemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'i Yebusi babwira Dawidi bati “Hano ntabwo uzahamenera.” Ariko Dawidi ahindūra igihome gikomeye cya Siyoni, ari ho habaye ururembo rwa Dawidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo Dawidi yaravuze ati “Uri bubanze kunesha Abayebusi, ni we uzaba umutware n'umugaba”. Maze Yowabu mwene Seruya aba ari we ubanza kuhamenera, aba umugaba w'ingabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi atura muri icyo gihome gikomeye, ari cyo cyatumye bacyita ururembo rwa Dawidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yubaka umudugudu impande zarwo zose, uhereye i Milo n'impande zose. Yowabu na we asana ibindi bice by'umudugudu bisigaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi akajya arushaho gukomera, kuko Uwiteka Nyiringabo yari kumwe na we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Intwari za Dawidi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ni bo bari bakomeye mu ntwari Dawidi yari afite, ni bo bafatanije na we kwerekana imbaraga zabo mu bwami bwe, bagafatanya n'Abisirayeli bose kumwimika nk'uko Uwiteka yavuze ku Bisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaba abagabo b'intwari Dawidi yari afite, uko umubare wabo wari uri: Yashobeyamu umwana w'Umuhakimoni, umutware w'ab'intore mirongo itatu. Yabanguye icumu rye kurwanya abantu magana atatu, abicira icyarimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akurikirwa na Eleyazari mwene Dodo w'Umwahohi, yari uwo muri abo bagabo b'intwari batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo yari kumwe na Dawidi i Pasidamimu, ubwo Abafilisitiya bari bateraniyeyo ngo barwane, maze abantu bahunga Abafilisitiya. Aho hari umurima warimo sayiri nyinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko bo bahagarara hagati muri uwo murima, barawurinda bica abo Bafilisitiya, Uwiteka abakirisha kunesha gukomeye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatatu kuri ba bandi mirongo itatu baramanuka basanga Dawidi ku rutare mu buvumo bwa Adulamu. Ingabo z'Abafilisitiya zari zigerereje mu kibaya cy'Abarafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo Dawidi yari mu gihome, kandi abanyagihome cy'Abafilisitiya bari i Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi akumbuye aravuga ati “Icyampa nkabona unsomya ku mazi y'iriba ryo ku irembo ry'i Betelehemu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abo batatu batwaranira mu ngabo z'Abafilisitiya, bavoma amazi mu iriba ryo ku irembo ry'i Betelehemu, barayajyana bayashyira Dawidi. Ariko Dawidi yanga kuyanywaho, ahubwo ayabyarira imbere y'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aravuga ati “Imana yanjye indinde kuba nakora ntyo! Ndebe nywe amaraso y'aba bagabo bahaze amagara yabo!” Kuko bayazanye bihaze, ni cyo cyatumye yanga kuyanywa. Ibyo ni byo byakozwe n'abo bagabo b'intwari uko ari batatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishayi murumuna wa Yowabu ni we wari umutware w'abatatu, kuko yabanguye icumu rye kurwana n'abantu magana atatu akabica, akamamara muri abo batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri abo batatu ni we wari ufite icyubahiro kurusha abandi babiri, ahinduka umutware wabo. Ariko ntiyahwanye n'abatatu ba mbere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya mwene Yehoyada umwana w'umugabo w'intwari w'i Kabusēli, yari yarakoze ibikomeye. Ni we wishe bene Ariyeli w'i Mowabu bombi, kandi aramanuka yicira intare mu isenga mu gihe cya shelegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yishe n'umugabo w'Umunyegiputa muremure cyane, uburebure bwe bwari mikono itanu. Uwo Munyegiputa yari yitwaje injunga y'icumu, ariko we amanuka yitwaje inkoni, aramusanga amushikuza icumu mu kuboko kwe ararimwicisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibyo ni byo Benaya mwene Yehoyada yakoze, yamamara muri abo bagabo batatu b'intwari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
